wspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><div class=\"td\" style=\"position: static; min-height: 20px; width: auto;\">处于减益效果中的敌人优先,给予 2 名目标 <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">4011&nbsp;</span>点伤害、目标<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"> <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">12</span></span>秒内减益效果持续时间&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">+45.8%</span> (以剩余持续时间为基准计算) ,同时再给予&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">14</span> 秒「分解」效果(每2秒给予 <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">800</span> 点持续伤害、减益效果无法缩短或延长)</div></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 81px;\"><td><div class=\"td\" style=\"position: static; min-height: 20px; width: auto;\"><p><strong>滑动U</strong></p></div></td><td class=\"\" colspan=\"5\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><div class=\"td\" style=\"min-height:20px;width:auto;\">处于减益效果中的敌人优先,给予<span style=\"color: rgb(84, 141, 212); font-weight: bold;\"> 3 </span>名目标 <span style=\"color: rgb(84, 141, 212); font-weight: bold;\">4111&nbsp; </span>点伤害、目标 12秒内减益效果持续时间<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\"> +45.8%</span> (以剩余持续时间为基准计算) ,同时再给予 <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">14</span> 秒「分解」效果(每2秒给予 <span style=\"color: rgb(84, 141, 212); font-weight: bold;\">950 </span>点持续伤害、减益效果无法缩短或延长)</div></td><td><div class=\"td\" style=\"position: static; min-height: 20px; width: auto;\"></div></td><td><div class=\"td\" style=\"position: static; min-height: 20px; width: auto;\"></div></td><td><div class=\"td\" style=\"position: static; min-height: 20px; width: auto;\"></div></td><td><div class=\"td\" style=\"position: static; min-height: 20px; width: auto;\"></div></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 81px;\"><td><div class=\"td\" style=\"position: static; min-height: 20px; width: auto;\"><p><strong>大招（DS）</strong></p></div></td><td class=\"\" colspan=\"5\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><div class=\"td\" style=\"position: static; min-height: 20px; width: auto;\">攻击力最高的敌人优先,给予 3 名目标 <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">7194 </span>点伤害、给予目标<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\"> 14</span> 秒「分解」效果(每2秒给予 600 点持续伤害、减益效果无法缩短或延长) ,同时有<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\"> 80%</span> 机率再追加给予「混乱」</div></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 81px;\"><td><div class=\"td\" style=\"position: static; min-height: 20px; width: auto;\"><p><strong>大招U</strong></p></div></td><td class=\"\" colspan=\"5\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><div class=\"td\" style=\"min-height:20px;width:auto;\">攻击力最高的敌人优先,给予 3 名目标 <span style=\"color: rgb(84, 141, 212); font-weight: bold;\">7524&nbsp;</span>点伤害、给予目标 <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">14</span> 秒「分解」效果(每2秒给予 <span style=\"color: rgb(84, 141, 212); font-weight: bold;\">800</span> 点持续伤害、减益效果无法缩短或延长) ,同时有<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\"> 80% </span>机率再追加给予「混乱」</div></td><td><div class=\"td\" style=\"position: static; min-height: 20px; width: auto;\"></div></td><td><div class=\"td\" style=\"position: static; min-height: 20px; width: auto;\"></div></td><td><div class=\"td\" style=\"position: static; min-height: 20px; width: auto;\"></div></td><td><div class=\"td\" style=\"position: static; min-height: 20px; width: auto;\"></div></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 43px;\"><td><div class=\"td\" style=\"position: static; min-height: 20px; width: auto;\"><p><strong>队长技</strong></p></div></td><td class=\"\" colspan=\"5\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><div class=\"td\" style=\"position: static; min-height: 20px; width: auto;\">敌方全体减益效果持续时间<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">+12%</span><div>&nbsp;(PVP时追加减益效果持续时间<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">+15% </span>)</div></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div><br><br><br><br><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">天子评价</span></p></div><br></div><div class=\"td\" style=\"min-height:20px;width:auto;\">她是妨害也是刀，她算个刀，分解伤害非常恐怖。</div><div class=\"td\" style=\"min-height:20px;width:auto;\">点火U的情况下，</div><div class=\"td\" style=\"min-height:20px;width:auto;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;text-align:left;color:rgb(255,0,0);font-weight:bold;\">&nbsp;14</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span>秒「分解」效果(每2秒给予<span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;text-align:left;color:rgb(255,0,0);font-weight:bold;\">950</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; text-align: left;\">&nbsp;+ (魂卡 <span style=\"color: rgb(84, 141, 212); font-weight: bold;\">280</span>点)&nbsp;点持续伤害、减益效果无法缩短或延长)</span><br></div><div class=\"td\" style=\"min-height:20px;width:auto;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; text-align: left;\">也就是 14 / 2 *（ 950 + 280 ）= 8610 点总伤害，再加基础伤害，一个SS技能造成上万伤害，</span></div><div class=\"td\" style=\"min-height:20px;width:auto;\">分解伤害无视防御，打防御高的对手是非常好用的。</div><div class=\"td\" style=\"min-height:20px;width:auto;\">注意了，DS的分解可以与SS的分解 叠加，叠加时配合魂卡最多 每2秒，造成&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">2310<span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></span>伤害 ，DS技能出招，混乱控制 3名敌人 10秒，对手基本上会被分解伤害团灭，一个DS胜负已分。&nbsp;</div><div class=\"td\" style=\"min-height:20px;width:auto;\">竞技场前十排名上，常也能看见她的身影，但是因为只在PVP方面较强，且对 分解debuff 体验不足，点火的人并不是很多。</div><div class=\"td\" style=\"min-height:20px;width:auto;\">如果你点火了，你会发现她的强大，如果你没点火，竞技场小心她。</div><div class=\"td\" style=\"min-height:20px;width:auto;\"><br></div><div class=\"td\" style=\"min-height:20px;width:auto;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ---奶牛 2021.06.24</div><div class=\"td\" style=\"min-height:20px;width:auto;\"><br></div><div class=\"td\" style=\"min-height:20px;width:auto;\"><br></div><div class=\"td\" style=\"min-height:20px;width:auto;\"><br></div>\n                  <i class=\"border-i-top\" contenteditable=\"false\" style=\"background:rgb(0,0,0);z-index:2147483647;\"></i><i class=\"border-i-right\" contenteditable=\"false\" style=\"background:rgb(0,0,0);z-index:2147483647;\"></i><i class=\"border-i-bottom\" contenteditable=\"false\" style=\"background:rgb(0,0,0);z-index:2147483647;\"></i><i class=\"border-i-left\" contenteditable=\"false\" style=\"background:rgb(0,0,0);z-index:2147483647;\"></i>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": null, "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 94234, "username": "兰花", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/3.png", "description": "", "follow_num": 1, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 112347176, "content_num": 39, "read_num": 83520, "like_num": 9}, "update_user": {"uid": 0, "username": "", "avatar": "", "description": "", "follow_num": 0, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 0, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "read_num": 0, "like_num": 0}, "game": {"id": 1164, "name": "天命之子日服", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1164/57/2022/0/26/583959.png", "alias": "dcj", "content_count": 1066, "follow_count": 708}, "themes": null, "seo_format": {"title": "", "desc": "", "key": ""}, "video_format": {"cover": "", "video": "", "width": "", "height": "", "duration": 0, "video_compressed": ""}, "contributor": null, "vote_list": null, "ban_imag